{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cd4UL3BLGZRWHdCB7mTYk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task task-1784147109798-2h88wn complete. Summary of the `[K1EV]` wire format (read-only research, no files edited):\n\n**Wrapper lines** (via `USBSerial.println`, `\\r\\n`-terminated):\n- `K1EV_CAPTURE_BEGIN,count=<u32>,capacity=<u32>,dropped=<u32>`\n- `K1EV_CAPTURE_DONE,count=<u32>,dropped=<u32>` (no capacity)\n\n**Per-sample lines** (via `snprintf` + `USBSerial.write`, manual `\\n` only, no `\\r`):\n```\n[K1EV] t_ms=%lu event_ms=%lu ev=%lu onset=%d bass=%d kick=%d snare=%d hihat=%d kid=%lu sid=%lu hid=%lu beat=%d bphase=%.3f bconf=%.3f bpm=%.1f\n```\n- `beat=` is `tev.beat_tick` (tempo flywheel), not `ev.beat`.\n- bphase/bconf: int16 ×1000 → printed `/1000.0` `%.3f`; bpm: int16 ×10 → `/10.0` `%.1f` (always fixed decimal counts).\n\n**Optional suffix** (appended only when flag bit `0x40` \"has_chroma\" is set — true only on decimated `sample_frame` rows, K1EV_STREAM_DECIMATE=3, independent of onset status):\n```\n croot=%d ctype=%d cconf=%.3f chroma=<v0>;...;<v11> mode=%u photons=%.3f\n```\n- croot: int8 -1..11 (A-origin, -1 = chord NONE); ctype: 0=NONE,1=MAJOR,2=MINOR,3=DIMINISHED,4=AUGMENTED; 12 chroma values, `;`-joined, `%.3f`; mode: uint8 `%u`; photons: raw float, printed `%.3f` (pinned by format spec, not default printf precision).\n\nKey parser gotcha: a row can be both onset AND sample_frame simultaneously, so presence of the chroma suffix must be detected by the literal `\" croot=\"` substring, not inferred from onset/beat field values.\n\nGate: whole TU behind `ENABLE_K1EV_STREAM` (bench-probe env only); dump triggered by decoupled serial command `k1ev_dump=1`, sent after `nov_dump` completes.\n\nFiles read: `SPECTRASYNQ_K1_FIRMWARE/serial/k1ev_capture.h`, `k1ev_capture.cpp`, `k1_ap_capture_telemetry.cpp` (dispatch site). Both `task_complete` and `hooks_task-completed` (success=true) were called successfully."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3233,"cache_read_input_tokens":131825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3233,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RzydP1YnwyNRMpbRjFdUMr","session_id":"16a76e6c-f56d-436e-9309-aa9c7ce3989f","uuid":"15fd4271-b8ff-4ead-beb3-fcb752afd7d3","request_id":"req_011Cd4UL1wB9mZbsxxrXeFwS","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"K1EV format research (read-only)"}
